			"locked": false,
			"text": "| Clock Type     | Tracks Real Time | Orders Events | Detects Concurrency |\n| -------------- | ---------------- | ------------- | ------------------- |\n| Physical Clock | Yes              | No            | No                  |\n| Lamport Clock  | No               | Yes           | No                  |\n| Vector Clock   | No               | Yes           | Yes                 |",
