			"updated": 1772785719409,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Confusion:\n    -> physical Clock - hardware clock -> current_time = now()\n    -> Lamport Clock and Vector Clock we do it manually. by maintaing variables in our code\n    -> Vector Clocks are used in Cassandra (early version), Amazon Dynamo\n    -> Conflict-free Replicated Data Type (Google Docs) please study\n\n",
			"rawText": "Confusion:\n    -> physical Clock - hardware clock -> current_time = now()\n    -> Lamport Clock and Vector Clock we do it manually. by maintaing variables in our code\n    -> Vector Clocks are used in Cassandra (early version), Amazon Dynamo\n    -> Conflict-free Replicated Data Type (Google Docs) please study\n\n",
